Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:20.25,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs28\an9\fad(103,1)\c&HEBDE4F&\3c&HAD5A27&}FREEZE...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:22.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, we have a long homeroom today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:25.63,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs24\c&HC393F0&\3c&H61278D&\bord2}TRUDGE TRUDGE TRUDGE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:26.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Do you think we'll be talking about \Nour class trip? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:32.55,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Just the same as always. \NCompletely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:36.14,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,But I guess it would be. \NThat's how it works, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:39.52,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\b0\fnTrebuchet MS\fs16\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H8D7E45&\an8}CLASS TRIP
