Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:39.52,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,So, that's the general schedule \NI'd like to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:42.52,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,And groups will have free time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:44.94,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,so think about where you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:47.65,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,I'll hand out the group \Nand room assignments later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:57.04,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H8D7E45&\pos(330.667,26.667)}CLASS TRIP
