Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:56.45,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,The Class Trip Arc begins now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:14.26,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an8\pos(320,98)}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
