Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.21,Basic Sign,SIGN; book; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\c&H555758&\bord1\fs16\frz9.814\3c&HD4E6CC&\fad(230,1)\pos(453.333,266.001)}YEAR 2 CLASS
