Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.21,Default,Morimoto,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:30.84,Default - Top,Morimoto,0,0,0,,This should be class rep work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:32.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\fnArial\fs16\pos(196.667,297.333)\bord2}EVERYONE IN THE\NGOING-HOME CLUB
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.97,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It'll go faster if we all pitch in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:34.93,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I wanna ker-chack the mega stapler!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:35.93,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,So sloppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:38.47,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H555758&\3c&HD4E7CA&\bord2\fs24\frz279.1\pos(462.667,158)}KONEKO PREFECTURAL\NHIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:38.47,Basic Sign,SIGN; book; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\c&H555758&\3c&HD4E7CA&\bord2\fs24\frz279.1\pos(205.333,194.667)}CLASS TRIP GUIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:38.47,Basic Sign,SIGN; book; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\c&H555758&\3c&HD4E7CA&\bord2\fs24\frz279.1\pos(119.333,200)}YEAR 2 CLASS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&HB5FFF2&\3c&HCA197A&\bord2\fs28\an8\pos(425,10)}QUIET FOCUS...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:43.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs20\bord2\pos(311.333,87.333)\frz11.12\fad(182,1)}DEAD-END\NPIECE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:50.40,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you help me, Nisshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:53.82,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's fine. I actually like \Ndoing simple tasks like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:54.99,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You're so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:03:03.58,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H5099EA&\3c&HB1BBFC&\fs24\an8\pos(425,10)}MUTTER MUTTER MUTTER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:57.70,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Seriously, when people say, \N"I have club activities"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:03:00.45,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,It's treated like a perfect excuse, \Nbut are clubs that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:03.58,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H97DFF1&\3c&H130A6E&\fs16\bord2\pos(537,252)\frz3.369}2-8 CLASS REPS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.33,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,If you can't, \Nthen don't be a class rep, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:03.58,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Is it just for your résumé?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:06.92,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,I despise people who only seem\Nto have it together and skate by.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:14.26,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H0410A0&\3c&HB3D1DE&\pos(434,49.334)\frz348.4\fs28}CRACKLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:10.42,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Behind their dazzling lives, \Nsomeone else is doing the work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:12.05,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,but no one pictures that, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:13.88,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Hon-chan, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.76,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'll put on a video of a funny \Ncomedy I watched last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.51,Italics - Top,manzai 1,0,0,0,,Then they slowly \Nturned around and said...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.35,Italics - Top,manzai 1; horror style,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.76,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H8F51EC&\fs16\bord1\3c&HC8D0F7&\frz297.6\fad(148,144)\pos(151.333,205.334)}HEE HEE...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.72,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.43,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Hey, Nisshi, do you have \Nany recent fun stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:26.02,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Huh? What about the video?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.19,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Any progress since you said \Nyou didn't know how you felt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:31.19,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You and Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.02,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.02,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H85FFB7&\3c&H77066D&\4c&H77066D&\bord2\shad1\pos(555.333,128)\fad(232,1)}JOLT
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:34.53,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um, that's... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.78,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I think I probably—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.32,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You two are doing all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H8715EA&\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\i1\an9\bord1}WAAAAAAH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:40.82,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:41.28,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.79,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial\bord1\c&HF9F9F9&\3c&H989898&\frz345.9\pos(282,124.666)}Day 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.79,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial\bord1\c&HF9F9F9&\3c&H989898&\frz345.9\pos(452.667,160.666)}Day 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.79,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Isn't it exhausting doing that \Nby yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.25,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,We've got about eight of us working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:46.54,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\bord2\c&HAAFFF8&\3c&H9065D7&\pos(364.667,149.333)\fad(103,64)}QUICK QUICK QUICK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:49.33,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,That sounds like too many, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.17,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm just an extra body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:51.79,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Lolz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.05,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Then, why don't you help us over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:55.30,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.51,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,First, go ahead and fold all that paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:58.34,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:05.64,Default,Mini,0,0,0,,Hey, for the groups, should it be decided \Nby lottery, or should we get to pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:07.94,Default,Morimoto,0,0,0,,It'd be better \Nif we got to pick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:10.15,Default,Mini,0,0,0,,Yeah, most people probably \Nfeel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:12.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Depending on how many \Ncan be in a group,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:14.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I bet there'll be some awkward pairings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:15.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:16.15,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.28,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What does "yeah" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:22.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You weren't listening, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.83,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,What's with this vibe? \NAre they in the middle of a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.71,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,How much of your trip do you \Nhave planned in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.38,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Aside from activities for the whole class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:39.84,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um, we've divided into groups, \Nand the groups are deciding where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.18,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh. Then you've gotten farther than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.60,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:46.64,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Nisshi is able to talk more than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.68,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,They've got a nice atmosphere going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.35,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Nisshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:53.36,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Just consider me invisible right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.36,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC1AD54&\3c&HE0DE9B&\b0\bord2\frz299.7\pos(151.999,186.667)\fad(941,1)}SHFF...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:56.90,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Gapacho said they're already \Ndiscussing their class recreation stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.36,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Really? That's so quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.61,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Hon-chan, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.61,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\b0\i1\c&H9E0688&\3c&HF8BDF4&}THUD THUD THUD THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:04.87,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Please don't enter \Nan I-know-nothing, I-don't-exist zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:04.87,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fnArial\b0\bord2\pos(476,268)\fad(475,1)}"I AM JUST BACKGROUND" MODE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:09.87,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\b0\i1\c&H1C191A&\3c&H9221E6&\an8\pos(232,20)}THUD THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:07.24,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I seem to be holding \Na conversation somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.87,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,but I feel my pulse in my ears! \NI think I'm going crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:14.38,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I'm happy, \Nbut I still want this time to go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:12.12,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTrebuchet MS\bord2\c&HD6FF9A&\3c&H8F6A08&}FWIP FWIP FWIP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.38,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\3c&HD6FF9A&\c&H8F6A08&\fnArial\fs16\b0\bord1\pos(87.333,238.667)\fad(142,1)}CONTRADICTORY
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.09,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,We're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.51,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,The two of you work so fast it's freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.72,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Well, I'll drop these off \Nin the staff room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:23.14,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(424,20)\fs28\bord2\c&H89AA29&\3c&HC1E7D2&}SHFF...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:24.39,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Want me to carry them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.60,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,It's fine. Just sit there. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Don't make it so I can't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:31.89,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Hon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:40.40,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I need something... to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.29,Default - Top,Yamada; simultaneous,0,0,0,,The wind ensemble sure is \Npracticing hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.29,Default,Nishi; simultaneous,0,0,0,,The sun has been \Nsetting earlier lately, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.42,Default - Top,Yamada; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.42,Default,Nishi; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.80,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.14,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,The group activity for our class trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:09.85,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, when your group decides where \Nyou're going, will you tell me in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:10.56,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:12.23,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:15.10,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I should ask why or what for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:15.94,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:20.73,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\an8\bord2\fad(1021,726)}IT'S NOT LIKE I HAVE ABSOLUTELY NO IDEA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.48,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.86,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I should be honest. Honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.66,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I-I understand and will do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:29.62,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's crazy polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.58,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Yamada?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,He left with everyone from his class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.09,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:40.88,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You didn't have to wait. \NYou could've left with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:43.30,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No, I'm already over capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.05,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, you're shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.80,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,I guess it's certain, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.72,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.76,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yamada, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:52.18,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I went and helped next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.73,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:58.48,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Today, I'm the only one who's been \Nweirdly self-conscious. I'm a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:06:59.44,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.82,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,before a class trip, \Nthe number of couples increases, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:03.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:06.57,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I guess it's to take full advantage \Nof the free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:07.61,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Phrasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.12,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Suzuki, Tani-kun, \Nwhat're you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:10.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:13.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:17.12,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H810199&\bord2\3c&HDBD6FC&\fs24\pos(555.333,172)\fnTrebuchet MS}AWKWARD
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:18.25,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What? Suzuki, are you still acting \Nlike that with Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:20.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Acting like what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.17,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Highly suspiciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:22.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sus—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:25.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Today just happens to be \Nthat sort of day, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.38,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What kind of day is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:28.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm usually more clever than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.68,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Tani-kun is laughing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.85,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:32.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:36.31,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, I'd like to spend my \Nfree time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:39.15,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wow! Well said, Tani!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:40.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:42.19,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.98,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yes, please go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:49.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H2E5777&\3c&H87F3F7&\b0\fs12\bord2\pos(520,286.667)\frz7.989\fad(352,360)}TRAIN-TO-SCHOOL GROUP
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.65,0:07:47.61,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Did Suzuki and Tani \Nseem kind of weird today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:49.07,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh? Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.16,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Well, as long as they don't say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:52.58,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,we can leave it alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:53.91,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.79,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? Are we going to \Nhead home together like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.00,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stop by the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.38,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.13,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.80,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Nice! What should I buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.43,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.18,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Azuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.68,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Hey! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.27,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Kawasaki! Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:20.10,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Did your group decide \Nwhere to go during the class trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.56,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,No. We haven't even decided \Non our groups yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.65,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,What? This late?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:28.95,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,We decided a whole bunch of stuff.\NIt's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:32.87,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,The whole class has a \N"I don't wanna say the wrong thing" aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:34.91,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,so no one gives a single opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:43.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&HF0DBD7&\3c&H86735D&\bord2\fs16\pos(433.333,100.667)\fad(523,1)}CLASS TRIP
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:43.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&HF0DBD7&\3c&H86735D&\bord2\fs16\pos(424.666,172.667)}PICKING GROUPS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.33,Flashback,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Then we'll decide the groups \Nby lottery. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:43.46,Flashback,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll do it by lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.09,Flashback,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Is there anywhere you wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:46.71,Default,group 1; girl A,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.72,Default,group 1; boy A,0,0,0,,Well, no. Nowhere in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:53.43,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! \NPlease give your opinion just a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:57.22,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,And then they say that \NI decided everything behind their backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:59.69,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Don't skip making decisions \Nor giving your opinion, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:02.23,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,C-Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:01.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0950ED&\3c&HB1CBFF&\fad(608,1)\fs28}ARGHHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.11,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You did good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:11.32,Flashback,Mini,0,0,0,,Hey, should we assign groups\Nby lottery, or let everyone pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:13.74,Flashback,Morimoto,0,0,0,,It'd be better \Nif we got to pick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:18.25,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,To be honest, I think \N a lottery is way better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:23.83,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,So, I fumbled planning the class trip,\Nso we're going to decide stuff fast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:27.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I knew it! I thought our class \Nseemed way behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:31.17,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,First, form groups of two to \Nthree of all girls or all boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:35.51,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,Then we'll combine each boy group with a \Ngirl group to form a group of five to six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How slapdash can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.56,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Two to three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:43.40,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\c&HCF3DD4&\3c&HF6F0F4&\an8\frz350.1\pos(229.333,54.308)}HANG OUT A LOT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:43.40,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\c&HE2535D&\3c&HFAF6F4&\frz27.07\pos(262.667,258.666)}HANG-OUT GROUP\N(+SUZUKI)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:41.64,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H2DCC2A&\3c&HD1F7E6&\frz24.01\pos(123.333,178.667)}ALWAYS TOGETHER
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:42.27,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H2DCC2A&\3c&HD1F7E6&\frz24.01\pos(123.333,178.667)}ALWAYS TOGETHER
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:43.40,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H2DCC2A&\3c&HD1F7E6&\frz24.01\pos(123.333,178.667)}ALWAYS TOGETHER
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:47.40,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,What should I do? \NIs there anyone left over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.27,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs24\bord2\c&H8E36EE&\3c&HEBE6F5&\fad(107,59)}GLANCE GLANCE GLANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.90,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&HFFE9FE&\3c&HD04096&\b0\bord2\pos(476,290)\fad(1,183)}(I'LL GO TO A DIFFERENT GROUP)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:54.66,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\c&HFDE8FF&\3c&HB347EA&\b0\bord2\pos(157.333,295.333)\fad(1,192)}(GOT IT!)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.36,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Did she understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.66,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\bord2\pos(410.667,52)\c&H88506B&\3c&HFEFAFA&}DID SHE UNDERSTAND...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Teacher! Can we have a group of four?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:09:58.91,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,No! That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:00.95,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:01.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:04.50,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,Just talk it out amongst yourselves \Nand make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:04.92,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(224,1)\c&H37FEEE&\fs20\bord0\pos(88.667,206)\frz27.08}IF IT GETS DONE,\NANYTHING'S FINE.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.92,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEFEDE9&\4c&HB484D7&\bord0\shad2\fs24\frz354.9\pos(214.667,108.667)}IN THE END...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.59,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,In the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:09.05,Default,Suzuki; Yamada; Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:09.42,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9BFCF8&\bord1\shad1\3c&H6E07D9&\4c&H6E07D9&\frz19.16\pos(273,109)\fad(313,1)}YAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.92,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF3A8F7&\3c&H702F79&\bord2\fs24\frz301.1\pos(125.334,134.667)\fad(272,1)}SIGH...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:15.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The truth is, I've already \Nbought sightseeing magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:13.93,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs32\bord2\c&H75FFFD&\3c&HCF1586&\pos(542.667,48)\fad(99,1)}BAM
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:16.60,Basic Sign,SIGN; magazine title,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\bord2\c&H85DDF8&\3c&H6565DC&\frz350.2\move(354,56,428,260,1934,2101)}TABIPPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.93,Basic Sign,SIGN; circle,0,0,0,,{\fs24\3c&H8371E3&\c&HFFFFFF&\frz351.3\pos(253.333,216)}FALL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.60,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wow! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:21.64,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HEA8F5D&\3c&HD4FCF4&\bord2\pos(348,47.333)\an8}FWIP FWIP FWIP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:21.06,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I'm glad I didn't have to be \Nawkwardly considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.73,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H83FFF9&\3c&H47621D&\bord2\fnTrebuchet MS\fs30\fad(184,1)\pos(545.334,146.666)\frz291}...HUH?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:23.73,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:28.23,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,If I worry about every little thing \Nthe whole trip, what'll happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:33.99,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Since I started high school, \Nit's like I'm in a group, but also not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:38.41,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I make sure not to get too attached, so I \Ncan go anywhere, and I keep my distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.99,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,It's easiest when it's just me, \Nor me and one other person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.25,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Still, maybe my social circle \Nis too small?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.21,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEC6F4&\3c&HA030E6&\bord2\fnTrebuchet MS\shad1\4c&HA030E6&\fs20\frz18.31\an7\pos(54,108)}YEAR 1, SPRING
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:46.79,Flashback,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you! \NWhat middle school are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:47.17,Basic Sign,SIGN; right box,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b0\bord1\pos(504.667,164)\c&HA357D0&\fad(228,1)}1. KAWASAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:49.63,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&HE0F9F8&\3c&HEAB027&\bord2\fnTrebuchet MS\shad1\4c&HEAB027&\fs20\frz18.31\an7\pos(54,108)\fad(103,1)}YEAR 2, SPRING
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:49.63,Basic Sign,SIGN; left; box,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b0\bord1\c&HA40D80&\fad(228,1)\pos(128,150)}2. SUZUKI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.21,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:52.76,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm shy around strangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:55.80,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,but for some reason, I tend \Nto get cautious at weird times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:10:59.39,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,And yet it's so easy \Nto pester Taira for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.52,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't pester me for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:02.60,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:05.98,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I was just saying, "Taira is \Nso easy to talk to." That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.40,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:10.61,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Well, of course I am, \Nfrom your perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:11.40,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.65,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you \Nto be nervous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:14.70,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:18.07,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Like, "What if I say this?" \NOr, "I want to look good here."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:20.33,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Worrying about stuff\Nlike status and feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:23.04,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,versus it not affecting anything\Nif you mess up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.45,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,the comfort level is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:28.13,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Not that I know if you \Nworry about that stuff, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.42,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:31.67,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:35.26,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira, it's as if I totally \Nlook down on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.05,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,That's because that's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:38.72,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, but when I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.80,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&HF0DBD7&\3c&H86735D&\bord2\fs16\fad(523,184)\pos(513.333,100.667)}CLASS TRIP
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.80,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&HF0DBD7&\3c&H86735D&\bord2\fs16\pos(542.666,174)\fad(523,184)}PICKING GROUPS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:41.30,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF4FFBE&\3c&HC35A50&\bord2\fs24\frz336.4\fad(441,309)\pos(310.666,168.001)}SILENCE...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.89,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&HC1FFBB&\3c&H82AA5C&\4c&H82AA5C&\fad(1,232)\bord2\shad1}SENSE OF ANXIETY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:47.06,Basic Sign,SIGN; magazine title,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\bord1\c&H85DDF8&\3c&H6565DC&\frz18.67\pos(301.333,231.334)}TABIPPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:47.06,Basic Sign,SIGN; magazine circle,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&H8371E3&\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\fad(146,1)\frz17.96\pos(309.333,302)}FALL
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:47.06,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fad(266,1)\an8\c&HE8BCFC&\3c&H7A38DB&\bord2\shad1\4c&H7A38DB&}NO SENSE OF ANXIETY
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.97,0:11:43.68,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That could explain it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.68,0:11:44.85,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:47.06,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, not the looking down on you thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.69,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.15,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:56.57,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Well, I have work today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:58.61,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Sure! Work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.08,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:04.04,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,what am I afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.08,Flashback,boy A,0,0,0,,Azuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:08.12,Flashback,boy A,0,0,0,,Are you free on Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.08,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:11.00,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,What are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.63,Flashback,boy A,0,0,0,,Just asking her \Nto hang out on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:14.05,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,What? I'll totally go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.71,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,Azuma, you can go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:20.84,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,I'm interested in that guy. \NWill you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.51,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:26.89,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,Azuma, you know I like him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:30.02,Flashback,girl B,0,0,0,,Let's help her out.\NWe're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:33.90,Flashback Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,I guess it's fine. \NIt's not like I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:44.95,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Being used... and getting swept along, \Neven though I know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.00,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,If that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.96,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,that has nothing to do with now, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:13:01.59,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Back then, I think I had even less of my \Nown thoughts and will than I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.55,Default,Kawasaki,0,0,0,,Don't skip making decisions \Nor giving your opinion, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:07.18,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,You're so right, Kawasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:10.64,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey! Azuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:13.36,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yoohoo! Good work today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:16.07,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Nabesato, this isn't \Nthe way you go home, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:21.15,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yeah. We thought we'd go shopping, \Nmaybe get a few things for the class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:23.53,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We're headed the same way, \Nso can we walk together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:24.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.91,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I don't go this way much, \Nso it feels brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:32.62,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, I heard a taiyaki shop opened up in \Nfront of the station. Let's stop by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.33,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Didn't you just eat a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.00,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Isn't there a second stomach for taiyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.46,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I've never heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:38.67,Default - Top,Azuma,0,0,0,,Can I go shopping with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:39.67,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yes! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:42.26,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,We're going to a drugstore. \NIs there one you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:44.68,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We're thinking of going \Nto the one by the statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:47.39,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,The one by the station's \Nsouth entrance is well stocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:48.93,Default,Watanabe; Satou,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.94,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I want to buy face wash \Nand moisturizer for a travel kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.94,0:13:53.52,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Azuma, do you know of any good ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.94,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Maybe buy containers \Nand fill them with your stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:56.86,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:00.69,Basic Sign,SIGN; left bottle,0,0,0,,{\c&H565662&\3c&HB7E9DD&\bord2\fs24\pos(260,110.667)}TEA
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:00.69,Basic Sign,SIGN; right bottle,0,0,0,,{\c&H565662&\3c&HB7E9DD&\bord2\fs24\pos(342,110.667)}TEA
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:00.69,Basic Sign,SIGN; holder,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\b0\bord1\pos(303.333,209.333)}FOR SALE AT THE HOTEL SHOP
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.03,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll have \Nsome where we stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.32,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:04.87,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,And this is the first chance we've had to \Nsee Azuma without makeup! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.41,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm a little curious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:09.95,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's not like there's no difference, \Nbut it's not enough to get a laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.08,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,so don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.21,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:25.47,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\b0\bord1\frz337.5\pos(251.999,241.334)}TAIYAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:23.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.43,0:14:25.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It looks like they're eating taiyaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:28.97,Basic Sign,SIGN; top right,0,0,0,,{\c&H546D88&\3c&HBEC2D1&\frz8.232\pos(448.667,63.334)}O {\3c&HC1DFF3&}D E {\3c&H32B1DC&}N
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:27.85,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:35.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Class trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:39.98,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Class trip, day 1: Hands-on learning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper right,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs20\c&H6525A1&\3c&HDBFCFB&\pos(570.769,36)}DAY 1: HANDS-ON LEARNING
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\bord1\c&HDDCFF1&\3c&H7C5D93&\fnArial\pos(302.717,74.719)}EVERYONE SPLITS UP TO TAKE\NTHE COURSE THEY CHOSE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; above fan,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E02A1&\3c&HE1FFF9&\fs12\bord1\frz343.7\pos(547.026,144.513)}PAINTING 1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; below fan,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E02A1&\3c&HE1FFF9&\fs12\bord1\frz343.7\pos(499.795,215.846)}PAINTING 2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\bord1\3c&H5F4EC7&\c&H3B50F2&\frz353.3\pos(52.102,10)}TR{\c&HE18DF8&\3c&H935DAD&}IP {\c&HCAFFFB&\3c&H7767AF&}GUIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; below Activity,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E02A1&\3c&HE1FFF9&\fs12\bord1\pos(126,204)\frz13.64}MAKING\NJAPANESE\NSWEETS
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; right of Activity,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E02A1&\3c&HE1FFF9&\fs12\bord1\frz351.9\pos(176.307,119.948)}CERAMICS
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.98,Basic Sign,SIGN; by her foot,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E02A1&\3c&HE1FFF9&\fs12\bord1\frz10.12\pos(76.667,242.667)}KUMIHIMO BRAIDING
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:43.78,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,All right, everyone gather up \Nfor each activity separately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:46.74,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I wish I could've done Japanese \Nsweets instead of ceramics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:48.41,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H415269&\3c&HDCE1EA&\b0\fs12\bord2\pos(238,52.667)\fad(146,106)}CERAMICS GROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:48.41,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H655B50&\3c&HE3E1DF&\b0\fs12\bord2\fad(146,106)\pos(500,28.667)}PAINTING GROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:48.62,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Isn't something you can keep better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:53.79,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H537DBF&\3c&HC1D7F7&\b0\fs12\bord2\fad(144,106)\pos(435.333,36.667)}JAPANESE SWEETS\NGROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:51.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We got the Japanese sweets \Nexperience through R-P-S!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.91,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,We'll eat enough for our \Nfallen comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:55.17,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Don't kill me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You can only eat what you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Nissan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.25,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\b0\bord2\frz344.7\pos(170,236.667)\fad(308,1)}JAPANESE SWEETS\NMAKING VENUE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:05.05,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,The pretty girl! Yamada's friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:07.51,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,The unrealistic couple \NNisshi told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Is it okay if we sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:10.01,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:13.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,N-Nice to meet you. \NSorry for intruding on your table.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.02,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(186,1)\pos(523.333,100)\fnArial\i1\bord2\shad1\c&HD1F6F3&\3c&H8220A8&\4c&H8220A8&}SMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:15.02,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,1)\pos(326.667,282.666)\c&H7B1ACB&\3c&HF0DFF7&\bord2}(NEUTRAL ATTITUDE)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.02,Default - Top,Honda,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:17.27,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Oh! She's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:18.52,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hurry up and sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.44,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,What an amusing woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.19,Default,chef; male,0,0,0,,You take this and go like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:28.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The teacher makes it \Nlook so easy, but this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you're so good! \NDid you practice in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Of course I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:35.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then why can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:35.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:40.59,Default,Honda; mumbling,0,0,0,,"Why? I'm just doing it how I was shown." \NHe's that kind of character, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.38,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:43.05,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. It slipped out a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:46.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Nissan, where is \Nyour group going tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.55,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I think it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.72,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,in that order. Right, Hon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.35,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:54.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's pretty much the same as us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We might end up \Nin the same place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:57.52,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.90,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.65,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,I want to go! I'm in! I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.27,Flashback,Satou,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:03.27,Flashback,Watanabe,0,0,0,,No objections!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.27,0:16:04.44,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then it's decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.53,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:08.03,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Th-That guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.32,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,He arranged it around Nissan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:15.70,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H8DFFBE&\3c&HB11AB8&\bord2\pos(338.667,64.667)}GRIN...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:13.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If we see each other, \NI'd love to take a picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.91,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? Um, I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.70,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HB03DEB&\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&HE2CEFD&\bord2\fs16\frz15.59\fad(433,1)\pos(110.666,71.999)}I'D LOVE\NTO...!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.96,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\bord2\c&H8705C0&\3c&HDCCDF5&\frz344.3\pos(481.334,113.333)}BIG ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:24.92,Default,Mini,0,0,0,,If the baths start with group 1, \Nthen group 7 is way later, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.59,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Want to play cards while we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:28.55,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! I love the classics.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:28.55,Default - Top,girls background; adlib,0,0,0,,It has to be, right? But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.22,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I brought dominoes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.14,Default - Top,girls background; adlib,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:32.01,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Now that's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.47,Default,Light music club A,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:34.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:35.97,Default,light music club A,0,0,0,,Suzuki, are you and Tani dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:36.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:38.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:39.39,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Huh? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.40,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,The two of them are always together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:43.44,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,but I guess this is how people see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.61,Default,light music club A,0,0,0,,We were wondering which it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:49.90,Default,light music club A,0,0,0,,When Suzuki is with a guy, \Nthere's no special meaning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:50.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\pos(104.667,36)\bord1\c&HCCFFFF&\3c&H8EC67B&}EXAMPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:50.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:17:02.25,Basic Sign,SIGN; sides,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\c&HBCFDF8&\3c&H6E57DC&\4c&H6E57DC&\bord1\shad2}SQUEE SQUEE\N{\fs28\bord2\shad1\c&HD59AF4&\3c&H92066D&\4c&H92066D&}YAY YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:52.91,Default,light music club B,0,0,0,,Wow, which one of you confessed first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.20,Default,light music club A,0,0,0,,What sparked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.91,Default,Light music club B,0,0,0,,Do you actually talk to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:59.54,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I totally get it. You just want to \Npress her with lots of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:00.50,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,How nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.25,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,She's acting like a veteran.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.25,Default,light music club B,0,0,0,,How far have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:03.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.75,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, you're really going for it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:09.09,Default,light music club A,0,0,0,,When they called you two at the \Nculture festival, what were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.26,Default,light music club B,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:12.39,Default,Mini,0,0,0,,Does Tani even have that kind of desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Honestly! We're closed for business!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.14,Default,light music club B,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. She's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.22,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.98,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Those things that everyone's \Nexcitedly imagining...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:23.56,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Not a single one has happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.32,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,Group 7! Head to the baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:32.66,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,When I really think about it, \Nup to this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:35.66,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I may have been pressing him a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(267,227)\blur1\bord2\fs24\c&HD4F4F7&\3c&HB686D8&\an8\pos(252,10)}I WOULD LIKE\N{\c&HBC8DDB&\3c&HD9D3EF&}TO HUG...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.53,0:17:35.91,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\blur1\bord2\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\fad(273,231)\c&HD6BE89&\3c&HD6DBCA&\an8\pos(150,10)}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:38.91,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,But he'll take my hand and stuff, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:38.83,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\i1\c&HCC5DE2&\3c&HDCDFF4&\blur1\fnTrebuchet MS\an8\pos(193.333,10)\fad(269,148)}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.50,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If I'm totally honest, \NI want him to start stuff even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:48.67,Flashback,light music club A,0,0,0,,When Suzuki is with a guy, \Nthere's no special meaning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:52.18,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Was I putting out too much of a \N"non-romantic character" vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:53.64,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! Suzuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.26,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Azu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.43,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Why the troubled expression?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:02.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want there to be developments.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:04.52,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:08.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I guess... I want that kind of appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:17.70,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\shad1\c&HBBF5F6&\3c&H5D8FEE&\4c&H5D8FEE&\frz344.8\pos(456,91.334)}GURGLE\NGURGLE\NGURGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.78,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki, you're more than cute enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:16.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Azu, this "cute" of yours\Nisn't how I want to be thought of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.70,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,1)\fs20\b0\fnArial\an8\pos(191,82)\bord2\c&HA44896&\3c&HE9CDF5&}NOT DENYING IT
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:22.33,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But... I mean, it's not something \Nyou should rush into in a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:25.13,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I mean, the peak \Nis everything that leads up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.79,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,So, slow is fine, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:28.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:33.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\shad1\c&HBBF5F6&\3c&H5D8FEE&\4c&H5D8FEE&\pos(459.333,83.333)\frz346}GURGLE\NGURGLE\NGURGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.84,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, I'd at least like to \Nsmooch sometime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:34.68,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,Smooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.72,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(142,1)\fs16\bord1\frz304.5\pos(162,176.667)\c&H8B6BCA&\3c&H000000&}SMOOCH...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:41.10,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Do you think I could... you know, give \Noff a "good woman" vibe like you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:46.31,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I mean, if I had to say,\NI'm more the "nobody really cares woman."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:50.73,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\i1\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\shad1\pos(509.333,188.667)\fad(185,1)\c&HF7A6D5&\3c&H8C367C&\4c&H8C367C&}I'M NOT A\NGOOD EXAMPLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:50.40,Italics,Azuma; internal,0,0,0,,She's blinding. Someone save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.74,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You were smart to bring a hair dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:58.37,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh. Azuma, your eyebrows \Nseem kinda different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:03.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, with this lustrous, flowing hair \Nand fresh-out-of-the-bath appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I do hope I see Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.58,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You can't wait until morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It'll be over in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Can't I just run into him at the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:13.76,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9024BB&\3c&HEADBFD&\fs16\bord2\pos(438.667,38)}TINTED
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:13.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want him to see the natural me, \Nright out of the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.76,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H9024BB&\3c&HEADBFD&\fs16\bord2\pos(236.667,77.333)}COLORED LIP BALM
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:13.76,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H9024BB&\3c&HEADBFD&\fs16\bord2\pos(453.333,193.333)}MINERAL\NFOUNDATION
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:16.13,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Even though it's a fake no-makeup face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:20.93,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:23.64,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(178,36)\c&H85FFCF&\bord2\3c&H907E30&\an8}SNEAK...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:22.97,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Why are you the embarrassed ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.85,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,It's totally fine to be introverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:27.19,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You're going to make fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:30.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,This is the key, \Nso he should be there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.57,0:19:38.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yoohoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:42.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada said you'd probably be over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.91,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HC848BC&\3c&HF9F9FA&\i1\an9}THUMP\NTHUMP\NTHUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:46.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a little different \Nthan usual, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes. My heart skipped a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:53.05,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H805CED&\3c&HF7F5FC&\i1\an7}THUMP THUMP THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.75,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,A perfect score? Suddenly, \Nthe solution I wanted has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:53.05,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I thought you were someone else, \Nso I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.05,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,No, I had it wrong! It was fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:55.05,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs24\pos(453.333,195.333)\frz16\c&H7FDBD8&\3c&H9A5447&\fad(190,1)}OH NO...!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.72,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But it was you, Suzuki-san, \Nso I felt better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:19:59.05,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:07.06,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\c&H830074&\3c&HDEB5F9&\frz26.1\pos(471.333,166.667)\fad(441,1)}CHANGING THE SUBJECT\NTO HIDE EMBARRASSMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:03.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you ended up in a big room \Nwith a bunch of noisy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:05.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you okay? It's kind of hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.06,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Don't find hilarity in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:09.23,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,They seemed to be having fun \Nplaying a card game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:10.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did you join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:12.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I didn't know the rules, \Nso I just watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:16.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun! \NThat goofy way guys get excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:20.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But not long ago, you probably\N would've turned away from all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:21.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Both the room and the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:22.74,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,That's probably true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:25.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:26.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:29.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Spending so much time \Nwith other people like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,A year ago, I'd never have\N imagined myself doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:34.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Which way is more fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:38.22,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I don't think it's about \Nwhich is more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:39.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9540EA&\3c&HB0ACEB&\fs16\bord2\frz13.03\pos(327.333,95.333)\fad(148,1)}OH...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:42.60,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I never felt particularly \Ndissatisfied with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:48.85,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,No, but that's the part of Tani-kun \N I fell in love with in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:49.31,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz6.834\pos(488.666,50.667)\c&HBCFEFB&\3c&HA8835F&\bord2\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24}SOLITARY
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:49.85,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:56.23,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,now I have confusion and worries \Nthat I didn't have when I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:58.61,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And things I wouldn't have \Nknown otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.11,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There are probably still a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:05.37,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I'm not \Nstill ignorant of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So, it's not "which one," it's "both"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:13.38,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah. And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ta— Yuu— Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:28.64,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,U-Up until just now, \NI was only thinking of wicked things!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:32.19,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:45.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:47.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:55.96,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:58.63,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay! Time to get back \Nto our rooms, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:02.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow! \NHave fun in that room of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:05.76,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,There's no need to get weirdly panicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:13.64,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:17.48,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,they stayed up long \Ninto the night of their first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:17.48,Default - Top,background,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:19.73,Default - Top,Honda,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to tomorrow!
